# Xcode
#
# gitignore contributors: remember to update Global/Xcode.gitignore, Objective-C.gitignore & Swift.gitignore

## User settings
xcuserdata/

## Compatibility with Xcode 8 and earlier
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout

## Compatibility with Xcode 9
*.xcuserstate

## Build generated
build/
DerivedData/

## CocoaPods
Pods/
*.xcworkspace
!default.xcworkspace
Podfile.lock

## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/

## API Keys（重要！）
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/*APIKey*.swift
**/*Secret*.swift
.env

## macOS
.DS_Store

## App Packaging
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM